cff-version: "1.2.0"
title: "TID-CMM — Threat-Informed Detection Capability Maturity Model"
message: "If you use TID-CMM, its open model or its public datasets, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Adineh
    given-names: Reza
    website: "https://rezaadineh.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ReZaAdineH/tid-cmm"
url: "https://tid-cmm.com"
abstract: >-
  An evidence-driven capability maturity model for threat-informed detection. TID-CMM
  measures eight domains and 58 sub-capabilities from 0 to 5, anchors detection reasoning
  to relevant MITRE ATT&CK Enterprise behaviours, evaluates telemetry assurance, and uses
  mechanical integrity constraints so capability cannot be claimed without intent,
  visibility, evidence and validation.
keywords:
  - threat-informed detection
  - detection engineering
  - MITRE ATT&CK
  - maturity model
  - security operations
  - threat-informed defense
  - telemetry engineering
  - telemetry assurance
  - detection validation
  - purple team
